menu "Gateway: console shell"

    config GW_SHELL_WRITE_COMMANDS
        bool "Shell commands that change the gateway (config load, restart, rebirth, mbread, card format, coredump erase)"
        default y
        help
            CFG-6. The console is reached only with physical access to the board (USB-C),
            which also gives the BOOT button and the flash. Production builds that want a
            read-only console (status, devices, config, config show, ping, coredump,
            coredump dump) turn this off.

endmenu
